stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Still
    Still --> [*]
    Still --> Moving : push
    Moving --> Still : stop
    Moving --> Crash
    Crash --> [*]
    state Moving {
        [*] --> Slow
        Slow --> Fast : accelerate
        Fast --> Slow : brake
    }
    state check <<choice>>
    Crash --> check
    check --> Repair : minor
    check --> Scrap : total
    state fork_state <<fork>>
    Repair --> fork_state
    fork_state --> Paint
    fork_state --> Engine
    Still : parked
    Still : engine off
    note right of Crash : call insurance
